@startuml class_diagram_requirements
title AI02 — Procurement calculation and result ownership
hide empty members
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam shadowing false
class "AI05 execution service" as Service <<application>>
interface "Planning records" as Records <<port>>
class "Private Backoffice adapter" as Store <<infrastructure>>
class "AI06 input adapter" as Inputs <<AI06>> {
  +load_inputs(+Execution, -Outcome)
}
class "requirements_planning" as Planner <<proposed Prolog module>> {
  +requirements_plan(+Input, -Outcome)
}
class "bom" as Bom <<implemented Prolog module>> {
  +bom_requirements(+Input, -Outcome)
}
class "PlanningResult" as Result <<aggregate root>>
class "Daily requirement" as Day <<result value>> {
  dueDate, productId, requiredUnits
  onTimeUnits, lateUnits, unfulfilledUnits
}
class "Allocation" as Allocation <<result value>> {
  sourceType, sourceRef, availableDate, units
}
class "Supplier proposal" as Proposal <<result value>> {
  supplierId, orderDate
}
class "Proposal line" as Line <<result value>> {
  lineId, productId, packCount, purchasedUnits
  expectedDeliveryDate, costCents
}
Service ..> Inputs
Service ..> Planner
Service ..> Records
Store ..|> Records
Planner ..> Bom : daily pizza demand
Planner ..> Result : calculates contents
Result "1" *-- "0..*" Day
Result "1" *-- "0..*" Proposal
Day "1" *-- "0..*" Allocation
Proposal "1" *-- "1..*" Line
class "Opening stock entry" as Opening <<snapshot value>>
class "Pending receipt" as Receipt <<snapshot value>>
class "Feasible batch" as Batch <<result value>> {
  batchId, productId, availableDate, producedUnits
}
Result "1" *-- "0..*" Batch
Allocation ..> Opening : openingStock (snapshotId, productId)
Allocation ..> Receipt : pendingReceipt (receiptId)
Allocation ..> Line : purchaseProposalLine (lineId)
Allocation ..> Batch : internalProduction (batchId)
note bottom of Allocation
  Each allocation references exactly one source.
end note
@enduml
